  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_dokuboss_00",
      "hash64": "7EE9C25EC927EBA9",
      "text": "Os... os he fallado...[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_system_01",
      "hash64": "F1B3A41EED808681",
      "text": "Hace algo más de un año...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_dokuboss_01",
      "hash64": "7EE9C15EC927E9F6",
      "text": "Ruego me disculpéis por no facerlo más a priesa.\\nTuve problemas de abastecimiento...[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_honooboss_01",
      "hash64": "3FEE639A2D55390C",
      "text": "¡Uala! Flipa, chaval... ¡Estas botas son la caña![VAR 0x0114(001F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 49,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_dokuboss_02",
      "hash64": "7EE9C05EC927E843",
      "text": "Su diseño está inspirado en el movimiento\\nNitrocarga...[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 55,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_kakutouboss_01",
      "hash64": "4918872BA1141559",
      "text": "Este uniforme me pega un montón, la verdad.\\nGracias por prestar tanta atención a los detalles.[VAR 0x0114(0022)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0022"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_dokuboss_03",
      "hash64": "7EE9BF5EC927E690",
      "text": "Nada me complace más que haber podido facer\\nun diseño a vuestro gusto, mi señora Inferna.[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_akuboss_01",
      "hash64": "36523EDB08117B0C",
      "text": "Con esto ya tenemos todos los uniformes\\nrenovados. ¡Gracias, Henzo! Te has portado.[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_akuboss_02",
      "hash64": "365241DB08118025",
      "text": "La verdad es que ahora imponéis cosa mala.\\c\\n¡A ver quién es el guapo que se atreve a llevaros\\nla contraria![VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 42,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 109,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_fairyboss_01",
      "hash64": "0E1DF61F5DCB6AEA",
      "text": "Están muy bien hechos, Henzo.[VAR 0x0114(0020)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0020"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_fairyboss_02",
      "hash64": "0E1DF51F5DCB6937",
      "text": "Los que se meten contigo por ser un friki de los\\nninjas y las novelas de época no tienen perdón.[VAR 0x0114(0020)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0020"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_dokuboss_04",
      "hash64": "7EE9C65EC927F275",
      "text": "La senda del friki es espinosa y está plagada de\\nvicisitudes. Mas es imperioso enfilarla sin esperar\\r\\ncomprensión por la plebe.[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 100,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 129,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_honooboss_02",
      "hash64": "3FEE669A2D553E25",
      "text": "Henzo, colega, ¡menudo discurso motivacional\\nte acabas de marcar![VAR 0x0114(001F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 65,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_kakutouboss_02",
      "hash64": "4918842BA1141040",
      "text": "¡Bien dicho! ¡Yo creo que eres un tío guay![VAR 0x0114(0022)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 43,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0022"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_akuboss_03",
      "hash64": "365240DB08117E72",
      "text": "Venga, pongámonos a entrenar de cara a la\\nOperación Star.[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 57,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_akuboss_04",
      "hash64": "36523BDB081175F3",
      "text": "¡Para algo somos los jefes! No podemos dejar\\nque ningún otro miembro nos supere en fuerza.[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_dokuboss_05",
      "hash64": "7EE9C55EC927F0C2",
      "text": "De acuerdo. ¡Que dé comienzo nuestro arco de\\nentrenamiento![VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 59,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_dokuboss_06",
      "hash64": "7EE9C45EC927EF0F",
      "text": "Oh, ¿qué ha uno de hacer? ¿Traicionar su\\ndevoción por la causa u honrar la ley?[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 79,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_dokuboss_07",
      "hash64": "7EE9C35EC927ED5C",
      "text": "El código es sagrado.[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_dokuboss_08",
      "hash64": "7EE9CA5EC927F941",
      "text": "Y, para honrarlo, me veo en la tesitura de haceros\\nentrega de esto.[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 67,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_waza_01",
      "hash64": "D28430A2470ED9B9",
      "text": "Tomad este artificio también. Os permitirá cubrir\\na vuestros adversarios de mugre.[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_dokuboss_09",
      "hash64": "7EE9C95EC927F78E",
      "text": "Os llamabais [VAR 0x0100(0000)], ¿cierto?[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_dokuboss_10",
      "hash64": "7EE63C5EC924D220",
      "text": "No os guardo animosidad, pues os habéis batido\\nen buena lid y justa ha sido la derrota.[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_student_01",
      "hash64": "E6637BEF86A2512B",
      "text": "¡Don Henzo!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_dokuboss_11",
      "hash64": "7EE63D5EC924D3D3",
      "text": "¿Ca-camarada?[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_nelke_01",
      "hash64": "BD2F1C2F0598E27F",
      "text": "Este chaval estaba empeñado en venir a verte a\\ntoda costa. Dice que tiene que hablar contigo.[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_student_02",
      "hash64": "E6637CEF86A252DE",
      "text": "¡Don Henzo, tened a bien escucharme aunque\\nsolo sea un momento!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_dokuboss_12",
      "hash64": "7EE63E5EC924D586",
      "text": "[EMPTY 61]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BDFF",
          "args_hex": [
            "003D"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_nelke_02",
      "hash64": "BD2F1D2F0598E432",
      "text": "[EMPTY 61]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BDFF",
          "args_hex": [
            "003D"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_dokuboss_13",
      "hash64": "7EE63F5EC924D739",
      "text": "¿A qué habéis venido?[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_student_03",
      "hash64": "E6637DEF86A25491",
      "text": "¡A ayudar a mi camarada!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_student_04",
      "hash64": "E6637EEF86A25644",
      "text": "¡Si seguís haciendo novillos como hasta ahora,\\nvais a terminar expulsado de la academia!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_dokuboss_14",
      "hash64": "7EE6405EC924D8EC",
      "text": "...[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 3,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_student_05",
      "hash64": "E6637FEF86A257F7",
      "text": "¿Sabéis por qué yo y otras víctimas del acoso\\nescolar podemos ir finalmente a la academia?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_student_06",
      "hash64": "E66380EF86A259AA",
      "text": "¡Es gracias a las acciones del Team Star y a\\nvuestra noble operación!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_student_07",
      "hash64": "E66381EF86A25B5D",
      "text": "¡No puedo dejar que expulsen a las personas que\\nhan hecho tanto por mí!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_dokuboss_15",
      "hash64": "7EE6415EC924DA9F",
      "text": "Lo lamento...[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_student_08",
      "hash64": "E66372EF86A241E0",
      "text": "¿Es que aún no tenéis noticias de la autoridad\\nsuprema?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_dokuboss_16",
      "hash64": "7EE6425EC924DC52",
      "text": "No, no sabemos nada desde aquel día...[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 38,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 39,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_dokuboss_17",
      "hash64": "7EE6435EC924DE05",
      "text": "Sin la autoridad suprema no habría Team Star,\\ny, sin Team Star... nadie disfrutaría de una vida\\r\\nescolástica rebosante de dicha.[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 130,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 40,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_dokuboss_18",
      "hash64": "7EE6445EC924DFB8",
      "text": "¡Hemos de seguir custodiando las bases hasta\\nque la autoridad suprema regrese, voto a bríos![VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 41,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_student_09",
      "hash64": "E66373EF86A24393",
      "text": "¡Pues sí que tenéis en un pedestal a esa\\nautoridad suprema! ¿Se puede saber quién es?[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 42,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_dokuboss_19",
      "hash64": "7EE6455EC924E16B",
      "text": "[EMPTY 61]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BDFF",
          "args_hex": [
            "003D"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 43,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_student_10",
      "hash64": "E66700EF86A56901",
      "text": "[EMPTY 61]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BDFF",
          "args_hex": [
            "003D"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 44,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_dokuboss_20",
      "hash64": "7EF04E5EC92D453B",
      "text": "Eso es algo que desconozco... Nunca hemos visto\\na la autoridad suprema en persona.[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 45,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_student_11",
      "hash64": "E666FFEF86A5674E",
      "text": "[EMPTY 61]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BDFF",
          "args_hex": [
            "003D"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 46,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_dokuboss_21",
      "hash64": "7EF04D5EC92D4388",
      "text": "Es una persona recluida, o \"antisocial\", como\\nafirma motu proprio.\\c\\nAl igual que nosotros, dizque también fue presa\\ndel yugo del acoso escolar.[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 66,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 145,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 47,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_student_12",
      "hash64": "E666FEEF86A5659B",
      "text": "Pobre...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 48,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_dokuboss_22",
      "hash64": "7EF0505EC92D48A1",
      "text": "Pero el hecho de que desconozcamos su faz y\\nnombre no cambia su condición de camarada.\\c\\nLo único que podemos facer ahora mesmo es\\naguardar su regreso en las bases.[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 165,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 49,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_student_13",
      "hash64": "E666FDEF86A563E8",
      "text": "Así que por eso no vais a la academia...",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 50,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_student_14",
      "hash64": "E66704EF86A56FCD",
      "text": "Aun así, ¡recordad que tenéis a más gente aparte\\ndel Team Star, don Henzo! No olvidéis que...\\r\\n¡vos sois mi camarada!",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 51,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_dokuboss_23",
      "hash64": "7EF04F5EC92D46EE",
      "text": "Camarada...[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 52,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_student_15",
      "hash64": "E66703EF86A56E1A",
      "text": "[EMPTY 61]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BDFF",
          "args_hex": [
            "003D"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 53,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_student_16",
      "hash64": "E66702EF86A56C67",
      "text": "[EMPTY 61]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BDFF",
          "args_hex": [
            "003D"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 54,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_dokuboss_24",
      "hash64": "7EF0525EC92D4C07",
      "text": "Estoy en deuda con vos.[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 55,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_nelke_03",
      "hash64": "BD2F1E2F0598E5E5",
      "text": "Acoso escolar, absentismo... Me he acercado un\\npaso más al meollo de todo este asunto, pero,\\r\\nante todo...[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 108,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 56,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_nelke_04",
      "hash64": "BD2F172F0598DA00",
      "text": "Solo ahora empiezo a darme cuenta de todo lo\\nque han sufrido, el motivo de sus acciones y los\\r\\nfuertes lazos que han forjado los alumnos.[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 139,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 57,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_nelke_05",
      "hash64": "BD2F182F0598DBB3",
      "text": "Me avergüenzo de haber estado tan ciego como\\npara no verlo...[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 61,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 58,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_student_17",
      "hash64": "E66701EF86A56AB4",
      "text": "[EMPTY 61]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BDFF",
          "args_hex": [
            "003D"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 59,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_dokuboss_25",
      "hash64": "7EF0515EC92D4A54",
      "text": "Rediez... Pensaba que el Team Star era mi único\\ny bienquerido tesoro.[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 69,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 60,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_dokuboss_26",
      "hash64": "7EF0545EC92D4F6D",
      "text": "Ahora me doy cuenta de cuán errado me hallaba.[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 46,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
